# No API Keys Required!
# 
# This project uses OpenStreetMap and Leaflet for all map functionality.
# Everything is completely free and requires zero configuration!
#
# The following services are included:
# - OpenStreetMap Tiles: Free map tiles
# - Leaflet: Open-source mapping library
# - Nominatim: Free address lookup and reverse geocoding
#
# Just run: npm install && npm run dev
# Maps will work immediately without any setup!
